        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kagan )_3 din bam e, kaiguangmei-",
            "Gan dithe, tingjin gan guang puthe;",
            "Neimik ni kei kan the,",
            "Kaiguang mei gan tang the ruprian,",
            "Nang chamdan luai latho.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Tingmik )_3 nkhuan makge,",
            "Kagan )_3 nkhuan mak ge;",
            "Jianmei khuan)_3 tingmik thui kaobam e,",
            "Gental gan hei luai jai kan puni the,",
            "Tingmik thui tat bam e jangna,",
            "Luai jai kan puni the.",
            "",
            "2. Ndauloumei 21: 13 jaolo,",
            "Kaikham )_3na kanei rukhou jan naimei tei;",
            "Thao jao khou )_3 gut nina cho?",
            "Ram baimei chang mak ge.",
            "",
            "3. Tuna ruh latchap tei kaikham thou tei cho?",
            "Tujang khang guang tucho?",
            "Kaikham chou khang guang tu cho?",
            "Phu o kagan gaimei nai bam khou,",
            "Guang nian lou lame.",
            "",
            "4. Kaomei tiangka khuan kagang e’",
            "Kandih khou hei;",
            "Nousuan khou kajao khang nousuan pheibanMakmei gut nu makna bam du puni,",
            "Zion rangpang thang tei."
          ]
        }
      }
